This directory is a modified copy of the gpui_linux crate from Zed v1.28.1
(https://github.com/zed-industries/zed, crates/gpui_linux, commit e8bc16ace).
zyuapp changed it in 2026: the manifest stands alone; the accessibility
tree's root follows the window's bounds and focus; on X11 a window keeps its
focus while an embedded child window holds the keyboard.
